00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:06.120
We made this sizzle reel,
it's a freaking animated thing

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.580
in partnership with-

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.823
- Cartoona.
- Cartoona.

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.996
Shout out to Cartoona,
sorry I almost forgot.

00:08:12.996 --> 00:08:14.330
- I didn't, I didn't forget.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:17.100
