the opening scene was in
the hospital in Los Angeles

00:27:18.510 --> 00:27:22.440
and we had this dream for Jack Black

00:27:22.440 --> 00:27:26.050
to play the patient who dies
in the very opening scene.

00:27:26.050 --> 00:27:28.550
- Yeah, because we were meeting
