00:28:25.060 --> 00:28:28.360
And then the show is about these two guys

00:28:28.360 --> 00:28:29.870
who've kind of gone off to L.A.

00:28:29.870 --> 00:28:31.570
and become a little bit L.A.-ified

00:28:31.570 --> 00:28:32.680
