00:29:10.440 --> 00:29:12.360
And you're kind of like,
ah, you know, like,

00:29:12.360 --> 00:29:15.450
you're still single, but
you're kind of interested.

00:29:15.450 --> 00:29:16.520
You were interested in her

00:29:16.520 --> 00:29:18.680
and kind of this long
lost love kind of thing

00:29:18.680 --> 00:29:20.670
and then when you come back she's pregnant

00:29:20.670 --> 00:29:22.410
and this is news to you.

00:29:22.410 --> 00:29:26.960
And then the final scene of
the pilot it reveals that

00:29:26.960 --> 00:29:30.550
