00:31:24.080 --> 00:31:28.010
- This was a community of people

00:31:28.010 --> 00:31:32.607
who were preparing to be
the first colony on Mars

00:31:32.607 --> 00:31:36.530
and in preparation to
become the colony on Mars

00:31:36.530 --> 00:31:38.170
they had to live in

00:31:38.170 --> 00:31:42.670
basically this replica biosphere on Earth

00:31:42.670 --> 00:31:47.550
for an indefinite amount
of time as sort of a test,

00:31:47.550 --> 00:31:49.300
like a psychological test

00:31:49.300 --> 00:31:52.630
and a sort of how well can
