they were trying to get there

00:32:49.560 --> 00:32:51.230
but they were a bunch of misfits.

00:32:51.230 --> 00:32:53.750
- Yeah, I mean, similar idea.
- Same idea.

00:32:53.750 --> 00:32:58.750
- And to be clear, I'm
not saying it was a,

00:32:58.939 --> 00:33:02.580
