00:33:04.580 --> 00:33:07.110
it happens all the time
in entertainment where

00:33:07.110 --> 00:33:08.828
two people come up with similar ideas.

00:33:08.828 --> 00:33:12.363
- It was a bit too obvious.
- I'm sure theirs was better.

00:33:14.310 --> 00:33:18.678
- At the same time we
put that one out there

00:33:18.678 --> 00:33:21.177
We also put "Beef Queen" out there.

00:33:21.177 --> 00:33:26.170
"Beef Queen" is the story of a family

00:33:26.170 --> 00:33:30.203
fast-food owned franchise, sorta
like an In-N-Out situation.

00:33:31.190 --> 00:33:36.190
And the father is basically
suffering from dementia,

00:33:36.730 --> 00:33:37.610
the guy who found it,

00:33:37.610 --> 00:33:39.050
sort of like a Ray Crock kind of thing,

00:33:39.050 --> 00:33:41.120
Like he founded this incredibly
