to start Love Queen

00:34:27.700 --> 00:34:29.650
shortly after joining the family.

00:34:29.650 --> 00:34:32.530
He's the polar opposite of the
typical Beef Queen customer.

00:34:32.530 --> 00:34:33.363
- And to be clear,

00:34:33.363 --> 00:34:36.560
Love Queen is the philanthropic
arm of Beef Queen,

00:34:36.560 --> 00:34:39.340
which is basically designed
to offset all the harm

00:34:39.340 --> 00:34:42.390
that Beef Queen does to the world.

00:34:42.390 --> 00:34:44.350
Love Queen is kind of trying to like

00:34:44.350 --> 00:34:45.870
minimize the carbon footprint

00:34:45.870 --> 00:34:47.540
or offset their carbon footprint, right,

00:34:47.540 --> 00:34:50.040
so that's the thing that
Maze is in charge of.

00:34:50.040 --> 00:34:51.210
But then your character.

00:34:51.210 --> 00:34:53.270
- Kevin Pacarkarski.

00:34:53.270 --> 00:34:54.960
Pacarkarski.

00:34:54.960 --> 00:34:56.366
Two cars.
- Read his district.

00:34:56.366 --> 00:34:58.920
- He's Danielle's brand new husband.

00:34:58.920 --> 00:35:01.490
He's a small town guy
who was up until recently

00:35:01.490 --> 00:35:03.910
just a manager of a Beef Queen in Ohio.

